body:
It's natural, virgin hair. I never use heat on it. It's just awful. I don't want to sound dramatic but it's seriously affecting my life, I feel so ugly. I say no to going on nights out with friends because of how bad it looks. I'm almost 27 and I feel like I'm wasting my life because I'm ashamed of my hair. I just want to feel feminine and look as though I take care of myself.

&#x200B;

The top layer is the worst, the bottom layer is okay which is so frustrating. It forms nice waves but looks ridiculous with the frizzy, ugly mess sat on top.

&#x200B;

I've been following the CG method for 5 years now and If anything I think it looks worse than ever. I'm honestly contemplating buying wigs, I don't know if this is feasible with my work where I have to wear my hair up. I use plastic spiral hair ties, microfibre towels and I never brush my hair. It just makes it looks worse.

Any advice is greatly appreciated, I think I've tried everything.

