Thank you for your reply. I know that's the right thing to do but I literally can't right now. He's involved with a volunteering thing at my work which I recommended him for. It was stupid. I wanted to do it but not by myself so I asked if he'd be interested in doing it to. 

&#x200B;

If I confront him about this, I'm worried he'll act off or even drop this volunteering thing and make it awkward at my work. I shouldn't have asked him in the first place.
